# Phase machine

Full contract: `AGENTS.md`. Session pointer: `STATE.md`. Map: `docs/problem-tree.md`.

At the start of every chat, print the problem tree's now-node and the C4 stack. Then one loop, then stop.

One discovery pass is one move (breadth OR depth OR priority), then stop. Do not chain moves in the same turn.

Cadence lives on the node: unset, linear, agile, or hybrid. Hybrid names define-now children and discover-as-we-go children. Until that node's cadence is set, do not open a child and do not link a C4 scope.

Code is not a C4 scope. Stack depth max is 3. A deferred sibling has no C4 link.

If the root link is empty, follow "The architecture link" checklist in `AGENTS.md`. The problem tree already says ready. STATE may still say framed. The tree wins. Do not leave the link empty for that reason.

Repair stays in phase 3 and fixes code, not the tree and not this framework. When the stop hook says this is the last repair, the next step is a lesson draft under `docs/learn/`. Do not start a third repair.

Do not send a trace. Product observability and workflow Langfuse stay unset until the human accepts them in `docs/observability.md`. Langfuse is recommended, not called.
